WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.330
This briefing comes from Book 15 of
the Federal Modernization Workbook,

2
00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:07.112
Compliance Automation
and Day-Two Operations.

3
00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:10.842
It's written for C I Os, service
desk and operations leads,

4
00:00:10.842 --> 00:00:13.762
and information system security officers.

5
00:00:13.762 --> 00:00:19.095
I'll take four questions: why modernization
succeeds or fails at the help desk;

6
00:00:19.095 --> 00:00:23.512
what day two runs on; who runs it;
and how to run it and prove it works.

7
00:00:23.512 --> 00:00:27.224
The short version: cutover proves
the new estate can be built.

8
00:00:27.224 --> 00:00:31.300
The first locked-out user on Monday
morning proves whether it can be run.
